    {
        "id": 10,
        "raw": "[name=\"能天使\"]   呀吼~",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "能天使",
        "content": "呀吼~"
    },
    {
        "id": 11,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_103_angel_1#8\",name2=\"char_201_moeshd#2\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#8",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 12,
        "raw": "[name=\"可颂\"]   注意看路啦，能天使姐，不要单手扶握把！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "可颂",
        "content": "注意看路啦，能天使姐，不要单手扶握把！"
    },
    {
        "id": 13,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_102_texas_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1"
    },
    {
        "id": 14,
        "raw": "[name=\"德克萨斯\"]   总算跟上你们了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "德克萨斯",
        "content": "总算跟上你们了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 15,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_102_texas_1\",name2=\"char_101_sora_1#4\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 16,
        "raw": "[name=\"空\"]   德克萨斯......下一次......请慢一点......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "空",
        "content": "德克萨斯......下一次......请慢一点......"
    },
    {
        "id": 17,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_102_texas_1\",name2=\"char_101_sora_1#4\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 18,
        "raw": "[name=\"德克萨斯\"]   抱、抱歉。我已经尽量控制了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "德克萨斯",
        "content": "抱、抱歉。我已经尽量控制了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 19,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_103_angel_1#3\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#3"
    },
    {
        "id": 20,
        "raw": "[name=\"能天使\"]   既然咱们已经汇合，那么下一步就是去找老板啦——",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "能天使",
        "content": "既然咱们已经汇合，那么下一步就是去找老板啦——"
    },
    {
        "id": 21,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_103_angel_1#7\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#7"
    },
    {
        "id": 22,
        "raw": "[name=\"能天使\"]   慢着，我怎么觉得少了点什么？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "能天使",
        "content": "慢着，我怎么觉得少了点什么？"
    },
    {
        "id": 23,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_102_texas_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1"
    },
    {
        "id": 24,
        "raw": "[name=\"德克萨斯\"]   嗯？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "德克萨斯",
        "content": "嗯？"
    },
    {
        "id": 25,
        "raw": "[name=\"德克萨斯\"]   ......拜松呢？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "德克萨斯",
        "content": "......拜松呢？"
    },
    {
        "id": 26,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_103_angel_1#7\",name2=\"char_102_texas_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#7",
        "name2": "char_102_texas_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 27,
        "raw": "[name=\"能天使\"]   欸？不应该是你们带着他走吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "能天使",
        "content": "欸？不应该是你们带着他走吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 28,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_103_angel_1#7\",name2=\"char_102_texas_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#7",
        "name2": "char_102_texas_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 29,
        "raw": "[name=\"德克萨斯\"]   ......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "德克萨斯",
        "content": "......"
    },
    {
        "id": 30,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_101_sora_1#3\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_101_sora_1#3"
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "raw": "[name=\"空\"]   ......难道我们把他丢在那儿了？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "空",
        "content": "......难道我们把他丢在那儿了？"
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_102_texas_1#2\",name2=\"char_101_sora_1#3\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1#2",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 33,
        "raw": "[name=\"德克萨斯\"]   ......习惯了我们自己的节奏，突然多出来一个人，是会把他忘掉啊。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "德克萨斯",
        "content": "......习惯了我们自己的节奏，突然多出来一个人，是会把他忘掉啊。"
    },
    {
        "id": 34,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_102_texas_1#2\",name2=\"char_101_sora_1#3\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1#2",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 35,
        "raw": "[name=\"空\"]   ——那我们是不是得赶紧回去帮忙？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "空",
        "content": "——那我们是不是得赶紧回去帮忙？"
    },
    {
